  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>S corporation compliance review</h2><p>Evaluate independent debt-basis, loss, and built-in-gain computations.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m2-tbs3-f1\">Gain on the full loan repayment</label><input id=\"tcp-m2-tbs3-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m2-tbs3-f2\">Loss capacity from stock and debt basis</label><input id=\"tcp-m2-tbs3-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m2-tbs3-f3\">Loss suspended for lack of basis</label><input id=\"tcp-m2-tbs3-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"tcp-m2-tbs3-f4\">Built-in-gains tax under supplied assumptions</label><input id=\"tcp-m2-tbs3-f4\" type=\"text\"></div></section>",
